Based on my analysis of the codebase, I need to implement the extractTetrahedra function that returns a vector of tetrahedra from a 3D Delaunay triangulation. I'll assume that Tetrahedron is an array of 4 Point3d objects.

```cpp
std::vector<Tetrahedron> result;

// Iterate through all finite cells (tetrahedra) in the triangulation
for (auto it = tri.finite_cells_begin(); it != tri.finite_cells_end(); ++it) {
    // Extract the four vertices of the tetrahedron
    Tetrahedron tetrahedron;
    tetrahedron[0] = it->vertex(0)->point();
    tetrahedron[1] = it->vertex(1)->point();
    tetrahedron[2] = it->vertex(2)->point();
    tetrahedron[3] = it->vertex(3)->point();

    result.push_back(tetrahedron);
}

return result;
```

